<title>CROATIA: Croatia Oct M1 money supply rises 2.8, M4 3.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Croatia Oct M1 money supply rises 2.8, M4 3.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Croatia</p>
<p>issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA MONETARY AGGREGATES  OCTOBER    SEPTEMBER    OCT '95</p>
<p> Reserve money (million HRK)  7,962.9     7,881.6     6,611.2</p>
<p> M1 money supply		 10,611.8    10,326.4     8,339.2</p>
<p> -Currency outside banks	3,945.7     3,918.8     3,194.0</p>
<p> Broadest money M4	     34,360.6    33,237.6    23,246.9</p>
<p>NOTE -- October reserve money rose 1.03 percent and M1 2.76</p>
<p>percent from September. Total liquid assets (broadest money) M4</p>
<p>rose 3.38 percent on a monthly level. -- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
